    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38502" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπείσ-ακτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>brought in from
			outside,</i> opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκεῖος, [Ἔρως] διὰ τῶν ὀμμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					420b
				</span></i>
			; <i>alien,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτόχθων,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				590
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῖτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.87
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				20.31
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					8.5.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ostr.</u>
				757.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1169b26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					110.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					8.7.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασιλεύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					1.5.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύραθεν ἐ.,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσει ὑπάρχον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				659b19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ ἐπείσακτον τὸ τῆς ἀρετῆς ἦν,
					καὶ μηδὲν αὐτοῦ φύσει ἡμῖν μετῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Muson.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					2p.6H.
				</span></i>
			: fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ἐπει] σάνκτην</span> (sic)
			is prob. l. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1231
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Nicomedia</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>capable of import,</i>
